  "description": "Fair Deal Property, Your Trusted Partners for Residential Property Sales\n \nAre delighted to present to you for sale No. 10 Mullan Mor, ideally located just off the Tuam Road and only moments from Galway City Centre.\n\nThis exceptionally spacious duplex apartment extends to over 115 square metres of cleverly laid-out accommodation across two floors, offering a floor are which is much larger than a typical semi-detached home. Bright, airy, and generously proportioned throughout, this impressive residence delivers outstanding value in one of Galway’s most convenient residential locations.\n\nThe first floor features a magnificent open-plan kitchen, dining, and lounge area designed for modern living. The contemporary high-gloss kitchen provides ample countertop space along with a practical breakfast area, while the expansive lounge benefits from double-fronted windows that flood the room with natural light and features a stylish built-in electronic fireplace that creates a warm and inviting atmosphere.\n\nAlso located on this floor is an exceptionally large double bedroom boasting oceans of floor space, double-fronted windows, and extensive wall-to-wall built-in storage. A spacious family bathroom completes the accommodation on this level.\n\nUpstairs, the sense of space continues with two further exceptionally spacious double bedrooms, both offering abundant natural light, generous built-in storage, and excellent proportions throughout. The bedrooms are serviced by a highly convenient dual-access en suite bathroom, providing both flexibility and practicality for modern living. \n\nThe upper landing itself is beautifully illuminated by a large Velux window, adding further brightness to the home.\n\nNo. 10 Mullan Mor offers a rare combination of size, location, and versatility. The property benefits from three large double bedrooms, two bathrooms, extensive open-plan living accommodation, and private car parking.\n\nImportantly, the property is not subject to rent caps, making it an ideal investment opportunity for purchasers seeking a strong-yielding property in a prime Galway location. Equally, it represents a superb opportunity for first-time buyers searching for a spacious and centrally located home that offers exceptional value for money.\n\nCall Fair Deal Property today to register your interest. We would be delighted to hear from you and to show you around.\n\nBrought to you by Fair Deal Property, Your Trusted Partners for Residential Property Sales.",
